WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
<v Geoffrey Irving>Geoffrey Irving: …I do think that a coin flip

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.520
<v Geoffrey Irving>is roughly the right model to have.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.920
<v Chair>Chair: Okay, and Aengus Lynch,

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.520
<v Chair>is that an analysis that you shared?

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.120
<v Chair>Do you think Mr. Irving is overstating

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.360
<v Chair>or perhaps understating the risk?

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:16.200
<v Chair>What's your perspective?

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Aengus Lynch>Aengus Lynch: No, he's not understating the risk.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.320
<v Aengus Lynch>The risk mostly emerges from building it very, very quickly

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.840
<v Aengus Lynch>because of a reckless incentive to do so

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.240
<v Aengus Lynch>before your competitor does it.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:32.920
<v Aengus Lynch>And I believe each company believes that the other company,

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.400
<v Aengus Lynch>if they take the lead,

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.240
<v Aengus Lynch>means that they have an irreversible situation

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.480
<v Aengus Lynch>they cannot catch up.

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.360
<v Aengus Lynch>And so they're panicking about racing

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:43.240
<v Aengus Lynch>to build it as fast as possible.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:47.800
<v Aengus Lynch>And that means that normal guardrails slip.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:52.040
<v Aengus Lynch>And then the stakes of how bad it will be

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:55.680
<v Aengus Lynch>are hard to measure,

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.480
<v Aengus Lynch>but easy to understate

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.800
<v Aengus Lynch>because of the qualitative changes it brings about

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.400
<v Aengus Lynch>when every single thing you can think about,

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.120
<v Aengus Lynch>this super intelligence can think about before you

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:05.380
<v Aengus Lynch>and plan ahead.
